flowchart LR
    classDef write fill:#ffe0e0,stroke:#c0392b,color:#000
    classDef read fill:#e0f0ff,stroke:#2471a3,color:#000
    classDef analytics fill:#e8f8f5,stroke:#117864,color:#000

    Client[Client]
    Gateway[API Gateway with AuthN and RateLimit]

    WriteSvc[URL Write Service]:::write
    KeyGen[Snowflake ID Generator then base62 encode with a permutation mask]:::write
    UrlDBPrimary[(URL DB Primary)]:::write
    CleanupJob[Expiry Cleanup Job]:::write

    CDN[(CDN edge cache for cacheable redirects)]:::read
    ReadSvc[URL Read Service]:::read
    Cache[(Redis Cache Aside)]:::read
    UrlDBReplica[(URL DB Read Replica)]:::read

    Kafka[(Kafka Click Events Topic)]:::analytics
    AnalyticsConsumer[Analytics Consumer]:::analytics
    AnalyticsStore[(Analytics Store OLAP)]:::analytics

    Client -->|POST /urls with longUrl and optional custom alias| Gateway
    Gateway --> WriteSvc
    WriteSvc -->|1 request a unique id| KeyGen
    KeyGen -->|2 return base62 short key| WriteSvc
    WriteSvc -->|3 insert short_key long_url expires_at| UrlDBPrimary
    UrlDBPrimary -->|replication| UrlDBReplica
    WriteSvc -->|return the shortUrl| Client

    Client -->|GET short key| CDN
    CDN -->|cached permanent link served directly no backend hit| Client
    CDN -->|cache miss or non cacheable link| Gateway
    Gateway --> ReadSvc
    ReadSvc -->|1 check cache| Cache
    Cache -.cache miss.-> UrlDBReplica
    ReadSvc -->|301 or 302 redirect| Client
    ReadSvc -.emit click event fire and forget.-> Kafka
    Kafka --> AnalyticsConsumer --> AnalyticsStore

    CleanupJob -->|sweep expired or stale urls| UrlDBPrimary
    CleanupJob -->|evict expired keys| Cache
